    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For years, Zamda Hussein assumed AKU's academic programmes were entirely focused on health sciences. One day, a Ward Education Officer walked into her office with an admissions flier on the Master of Education programme. Following a thorough review of the curriculum and her desire to pursue a Master's degree, Zamda applied to AKU.",
